      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Doorstep Delivery Handover, Inventory Verification &amp; Placement at Mumbai</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>At Mumbai, the final delivery and uncrating process is a structured routine that guarantees accuracy, safety, and customer satisfaction. The protocol begins with a daylight verification against the original inventory bilty, proceeds through systematic testing of all electrical and mechanical components, and culminates in the careful placement of furniture and efficient debris removal.</p>

