    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Daylight Verification:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Upon arrival, the delivery team cross‑checks each item against the signed bilty. A handheld scanner captures barcodes, and a supervisor records any discrepancies on a mobile app. If a mismatch is detected, the item is flagged, a photo is taken, and the discrepancy is logged for immediate resolution.</p>
