    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Debris Removal:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Packing debris is collected in color‑coded bins: cardboard, plastic, and glass. A dedicated crew disposes of or recycles materials within 30 minutes of uncrating, ensuring the site remains tidy and safe for the client.</p>
