</div>

<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">The entire sequence is timed to finish within a 4‑hour window, allowing the client to start using their space with minimal downtime.</p>
